Package: appclip-manager
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-3-0, libsqlite3-0, libappindicator3-1
Maintainer: Jeyaul Hoque <contact@jeyaulhoque.pages.dev>
Homepage: https://jeyaulhoque.pages.dev/
Description: Manage installed apps and clipboard history on Ubuntu
 AppClip Manager lets you view and uninstall installed applications
 (APT, Snap, Flatpak) and keeps a searchable history of everything
 you copy to the clipboard, with the ability to save clips.

